    <tags>ai assistant local privacy voice llm desktop</tags>
    <summary>Local hardware-accelerated AI desktop assistant</summary>
    <description>Qube is a fully local, privacy-first, voice-to-voice AI desktop assistant. It integrates speech-to-text, text-to-speech, retrieval-augmented generation, and local LLM inference into a native PyQt6 desktop shell.</description>
